blem "$\\int \\frac{2+{x}^{4}}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Using the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{2+{x}^{4}}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}}+\\frac{{x}^{4}}{{x}^{2}})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{2}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x+\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int {x}^{-2}\\,\\text{d}x+\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2(\\frac{{x}^{-1}}{(-1)})+\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{x}+\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-113789/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a58c0a18-4221-50f1-b31c-ae58d099d79d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-113789"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-49174/selection/36d47b2026029275204b86de13a61d937ffa6b650191e932761623037c23e6c0" :answer/id #uuid "10bc5287-28d6-5c0d-b1e4-7ee90841592a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{5}}{5}+2{x}^{3}+9x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49174/selection/87c1caf608d9f5b5799d1fe27c64288496e21f03ddf18dbee4bc21203ce2cc60" :answer/id #uuid "dc263731-0a3e-53fe-9231-cc25a8b9298f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{5}}{5}-2{x}^{3}+9x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49174/selection/6f76f895ef4588e718ecea9af0a3d23ddb69df8f97fd05965278220c107a1e09" :answer/id #uuid "f707efa4-3255-5a6b-a800-ba6a5aa4c6e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{5}}{5}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49174/selection/0acae265e3f550a2865659e93db307756c5acfadd6509bb8b40da95aa9c8f2ec" :answer/id #uuid "32c29acd-6a39-538f-b706-74bafd362ee9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{5}}{5}-2{x}^{3}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49174/selection/ab4dc4f046464c9b081d7479b3f263f0a2d0b6cc6e34d62de1cddd4f11df9bc3" :answer/id #uuid "807027bd-c67d-53f2-b47a-79583ad7fcd4" :answer/type :